# Every text file has Unix line endings (LF), in the repository and in every
# checkout, whatever Git for Windows' core.autocrlf asks for, so the files on
# disk agree with what cargo fmt, sed, scripts, and editors write into them.
# The engine's tools\line_endings.ps1 -Path <this checkout> switches a
# checkout made before this file.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
